invalid type: string "They serve different purposes.\n\n---\n\n# 60. RAG Is a System, Not Just a Vector Database\n\nIt is tempting to think of RAG as:\n\n```text\nPDF -> Embeddings -> Vector DB -> LLM\n```\n\nBut production RAG is broader.\n\nIt includes:\n\n```text\nData ingestion\nChunking\nMetadata\nEmbedding\nIndexing\nRetrieval\nFiltering\nReranking\nContext construction\nGeneration\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ